<resources>
    <!--
      The only wording in this module, and the only wording in the project that names a particular
      service while explaining a monitored item.

      It lives here because it belongs to the Uptime Kuma integration. The condition it answers is
      described in neutral terms by MonitorNote.Kind, and the neutral half of the sentence comes
      from the application's own resources; what to do about the condition is a statement about
      this one service, and a second integration reporting the same condition must be able to give
      different advice without this sentence following it around.

      Referenced from KumaMonitorMapping and resolved on the screen that draws the item.
    -->
    <string name="kuma_note_contradicting_rows">A restart of Uptime Kuma usually resolves this.</string>
</resources>
